N-US\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: 'Be Vietnam Pro';\">N\u1ed7 l\u1ef1c h\u1ebft m\u00ecnh, t\u1eadn t\u00e2m v\u1edbi t\u1eebng h\u1ecdc vi\u00ean khi theo h\u1ecdc t\u1ea1i Trung t\u00e2m \u0111\u1ea3m b\u1ea3o ch\u1ea5t l\u01b0\u1ee3ng \u0111\u00e0o t\u1ea1o, t\u1ea1o uy t\u00edn v\u1edbi gia \u0111\u00ecnh h\u1ecdc vi\u00ean c\u0169ng nh\u01b0 \u0111\u1ed1i t\u00e1c t\u1ea1i Nh\u1eadt B\u1ea3n<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-left: 0mm; text-indent: 0mm; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Be Vietnam Pro';\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">2. <\/span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">T\u00d4N TR\u1eccNG \u0110O\u00c0N K\u1ebeT<\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: 'Be Vietnam Pro';\">T\u00f4n tr\u1ecdng tin t\u01b0\u1edfng l\u1eabn nhau s\u1eb5n s\u00e0ng h\u1ee3p t\u00e1c, g\u00f3p \u00fd, chia s\u1ebb kh\u00f3 kh\u0103n v\u1edbi \u0111\u1ed3ng nghi\u1ec7p, kh\u00f4ng c\u00f3 th\u00e1i \u0111\u1ed9 thi\u1ebfu thi\u1ec7n ch\u00ed, g\u00e2y chia r\u1ebd n\u1ed9i b\u1ed9. T\u1ea5t c\u1ea3 v\u00ec m\u1ed9t m\u00f4i tr\u01b0\u1eddng l\u00e0m vi\u1ec7c c\u1edfi m\u1edf s\u00e1ng t\u1ea1o v\u00e0 ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n h\u01a1n<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-left: 0mm; text-indent: 0mm; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Be Vietnam Pro';\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">3. <\/span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">D\u00c1M TH\u1eec<\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: 'Be Vietnam Pro';\">S\u1eb5n s\u00e0ng ch\u1ea5p nh\u1eadn th\u1eed th\u00e1ch v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng tr\u1ea3i nghi\u1ec7m m\u1edbi, khuy\u1ebfn kh\u00edch ph\u00e1t tri\u1ec3n c\u00e1c \u00fd t\u01b0\u1edfng m\u1edbi t\u01b0 duy v\u00e0 c\u00e1ch nh\u00ecn, c\u00e1ch gi\u1ea3ng d\u1ea1y ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi t\u1eebng h\u1ecdc vi\u00ean.<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-left: 0mm; text-indent: 0mm; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Be Vietnam Pro';\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">4. <\/span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">KH\u00c1C BI\u1ec6T<\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: 'Be Vietnam Pro';\">Lu\u00f4n n\u1ed7 l\u1ef1c t\u1ea1o ra gi\u00e1 tr\u1ecb kh\u00e1c bi\u1ec7t cho C\u00f4ng ty. M\u1ed7i h\u1ecdc vi\u00ean khi theo h\u1ecdc t\u1ea1i TSUBASA ph\u1ea3i \u0111\u1ea1t \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ki\u1ebfn th\u1ee9c t\u1ed1t nh\u1ea5t, s\u1ef1 h\u00e0i l\u00f2ng c\u1ee7a h\u1ecdc vi\u00ean l\u00e0 th\u01b0\u1edbc \u0111o c\u1ee7a th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-left: 0mm; text-indent: 0mm; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Be Vietnam Pro';\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">5. <\/span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">TRUNG TH\u1ef0C<\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: 'Be Vietnam Pro';\">Lu\u00f4n trung th\u1ef1c minh b\u1ea1ch, t\u01b0 v\u1ea5n \u0111\u00fang ch\u00ednh x\u00e1c m\u1ecdi th\u00f4ng tin li\u00ean quan t\u1edbi ch\u01b0\u01a1ng tr\u00ecnh Du h\u1ecdc , XKL\u0110 Nh\u1eadt B\u1ea3n. Chu\u1ea9n m\u1ef1c \u0111\u1ea1o \u0111\u1ee9c ngh\u1ec1 nghi\u1ec7p ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi ph\u00e1p lu\u1eadt, theo c\u00e1c ti\u00eau chu\u1ea9n qu\u1ed1c t\u1ebf.<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-left: 0mm; text-indent: 0mm; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Be Vietnam Pro';\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">6. <\/span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">KH\u00d4NG NG\u1eeaNG H\u1eccC H\u1eceI<\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: 'Be Vietnam Pro';\">Lu\u00f4n t\u00ecm hi\u1ec3u v\u00e0 ti\u1ebfp c\u1eadn nh\u1eefng ph\u01b0\u01a1ng ph\u00e1p \u0111\u00e0o t\u1ea1o m\u1edbi ph\u00f9 h\u1ee3p v\u1edbi t\u1eebng h\u1ecdc vi\u00ean, n\u00e2ng cao hi\u1ec3u qu\u1ea3 trong c\u00f4ng vi\u1ec7c.<\/span><\/p><p style=\"margin-left: 0mm; text-indent: 0mm; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Be Vietnam Pro';\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">7. <\/span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13pt;\">TH\u1eb2NG TH\u1eaeN<\/span><\/span><\/p><p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 13pt; font-family: 'Be Vietnam Pro';\">M\u1ea1nh d\u1ea1n trao \u0111\u1ed5i g\u00f3p \u00fd ki\u1ebfn v\u1edbi nhau \u0111\u1ec3 n\u00e2ng cao hi\u1ec7u qu\u1ea3 trong c\u00f4ng vi\u1ec7c. Th\u1eb3ng th\u1eafn ch\u1ec9 ra c\u00e1i thi\u1ebfu c\u1ee7a h\u1ecdc vi\u00ean cho gia \u0111\u00ecnh \u0111\u1ec3 k\u1ebft h\u1ee3p gi\u00e1o d\u1ee5c x\u00e2y d\u1ef1ng h\u00e0nh trang t\u1ed1t nh\u1ea5t cho h\u1ecdc vi\u00ean khi sang Nh\u1eadt B\u1ea3n.<\/span><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-46ae351 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default sc_fly_static\" data-id=\"46ae351\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-extended\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-0a23691 sc_content_align_inherit sc_layouts_column_icons_position_left sc_fly_static\" data-id=\"0a23691\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-98fdec3 elementor-view-default elementor-posit